  "caveats": [
    "Current fields and Reviewed agree on >=1.0.0-beta.10,<1.0.0-beta.13, fixed beta.13, while the prose still says beta.12 is latest and no fix.",
    "Requires editor capability, a base64-returning image provider, local storage and no configured global base URL. The attacker controls fetch origin only, not the fixed image path; generic arbitrary-path metadata retrieval is not demonstrated.",
